# Learnings & Mistakes

This file tracks mistakes the AI has made and corrections from the developer.
**After every correction, add a new entry here so the mistake is never repeated.**

Format: `- [CATEGORY] Description of what went wrong and the correct approach`

## Rules

- [PACKAGES] Always use `bun`, never `npm` or `yarn`
- [IMPORTS] Always use `@/` path alias for imports — never relative paths like `../../`
- [COMPONENTS] Never put business logic in components — extract to Context providers
- [TYPES] Prefer `type` over `interface` — never use `enum`, use string literal unions instead
- [SUPABASE] Always use `createClient()` from `@/lib/supabase/server` in server components/actions, `createBrowserClient()` from `@/lib/supabase/client` in client components
- [UI] Always check `components/ui/` before creating any new UI primitive — it likely already exists
- [ENV] Never hardcode secrets or API keys — always use environment variables from `@/lib/env`

